---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTA from "@/components/sections/CTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Cllipify's mission to help creators make better explainer videos with AI."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">
          You Explain It.
          <br /><span class="text-orange">We Illustrate It.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          Cllipify transforms talking-head videos into visually-rich content that actually helps viewers understand.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">The Problem</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Explainer videos are powerful—but creating them is painful. You spend hours editing,
            searching for stock footage, and adding graphics that never quite match what you're
            saying. The result? Generic videos that don't help your audience learn.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Solution</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Cllipify listens to your video, understands what you're explaining, and automatically
            generates relevant visuals—flowcharts when you describe a process, charts when you
            mention data, diagrams when you explain concepts. Not generic B-roll, but contextual
            graphics synced perfectly to your narration.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Who We Help</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Course creators, educators, consultants, and thought leaders who want to produce
            professional explainer videos without spending hours in editing software. If you
            can explain something on camera, Cllipify can help you visualize it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">How It Works</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Upload your video. Our AI transcribes it with word-level accuracy, removes filler
            words like "um" and "uh", and analyzes your content to identify opportunities for
            visuals. You review what the AI generates, make any tweaks, style your subtitles,
            and export a polished video in any format.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
